# Jazzy Hotkeys' Mod Settings. CoE5SE reads this file right after JazzyHotkeys.c5m.

# One key setting per key of each line of the game's Keyboard Shortcuts list, named after its key
# action (map_end_turn is coe5.keyAction.mapEndTurn), on a page per list section. Each group is
# one screen, so no two lines of a screen hold the same key. No player can pick Esc, so every
# line that has Esc is fixed; Esc opens the Game Menu on the map beside F10.
# JazzyHotkeys.lua finds each setting by its key action's name, so a renamed setting is a key
# the script never reads.

newsettingpage map
label "Map"

newsetting map_shortcuts_list
key
default "?"
label "List keyboard shortcuts"
group "map"

newsetting map_recruit
key
default "r"
label "Recruit"
group "map"

newsetting map_end_turn
key
default "y"
label "End turn"
group "map"

